      <details><summary>How much does Shockwave Therapy cost in Canada?</summary><p>Typical prices in Canada run $75 to $150 per session. Prices vary by clinic, city and what the session includes, and benefits may reimburse part of the cost when the visit is billed under the right category.</p></details>
